  "note": "Load form (research/load-harness.md) for L01b's sql twins, on the trace form's schema and seed at 10x: statements per request over each step, from pg_stat_statements, with batches of 100 rows. A twin reports when it sends at least five times the statements per request the other does, and at least 10. Each step runs at a fixed arrival rate (k6), each twin judged against the other over 3 repeats, every finding under the timing rule. defects are what the planted twin must report and the clean twin must not; every other judged step is a decoy, in both twins.",
